LibreSSL's openssl(1) does not implement ED448.  Use ED25519 as the portable
default for notification-server TLS certificate generation; ED448 remains
selectable when a compatible command-line implementation is installed.

Index: src/Simplex/Messaging/Notifications/Server/Main.hs
--- src/Simplex/Messaging/Notifications/Server/Main.hs.orig
+++ src/Simplex/Messaging/Notifications/Server/Main.hs
@@ -287,7 +287,7 @@
           ( long "sign-algorithm"
               <> short 'a'
               <> help "Signature algorithm used for TLS certificates: ED25519, ED448"
-              <> value ED448
+              <> value ED25519
               <> showDefault
               <> metavar "ALG"
           )
